k, use headphones for audio, and be prepared to relocate if staff need the space for testing.","short_summary":"Third-floor rooms designated for individual and group work.","evidence_claim":"The third-floor Lavery Library map lists both group and individual study rooms.","source_url":"https://www.sjf.edu/library/about/library-maps/","source_title":"Lavery Library Maps","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Study rooms are first-come, first-served, and library staff may ask users to relocate for technology, noise, time, or testing needs.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"writing-tutoring-room-302","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Writing and Tutoring Room 302","title":"Use Writing and Tutoring Room 302","subtitle":"Lavery Library, third floor","notes":"Check whether tutoring is underway before settling in; when the room is open, keep it quiet and use headphones for any audio.","short_summary":"A third-floor room that is available outside tutoring use.","evidence_claim":"Lavery Library's room-use policy identifies Writing and Tutoring Room 302, gives priority to tutoring, and says it is otherwise available for students.","source_url":"https://www.sjf.edu/library/about/policies/room-use-policies/","source_title":"Lavery Library Room Use Policies","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Tutoring has priority. Unless in use for tutoring, the room is available to students; maintain a quiet atmosphere and use headphones for audio.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"writing-tutoring-room-303","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Writing and Tutoring Room 303","title":"Use Writing and Tutoring Room 303","subtitle":"Lavery Library, third floor","notes":"Use this room for quiet work when it is not serving tutoring; keep headphones handy and move if staff need it for tutoring.","short_summary":"A second designated writing-and-tutoring room for quiet work.","evidence_claim":"Lavery Library's room-use policy identifies Writing and Tutoring Room 303, gives priority to tutoring, and says it is otherwise available for students.","source_url":"https://www.sjf.edu/library/about/policies/room-use-policies/","source_title":"Lavery Library Room Use Policies","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Tutoring has priority. Unless in use for tutoring, the room is available to students; maintain a quiet atmosphere and use headphones for audio.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"pritchard-family-seminar-room-l306","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Pritchard Family Seminar Room","title":"Plan a session in the Pritchard Family Seminar Room","subtitle":"Lavery Library, third floor, L-306","notes":"Use this 14-seat classroom only when it is not in use by a library building partner; confirm availability before bringing a group.","short_summary":"A named third-floor seminar room with 14 seats.","evidence_claim":"Lavery Library maps list the Pritchard Family Seminar Room as L-306; the room-use policy lists L-306 as a 14-seat classroom.","source_url":"https://www.sjf.edu/library/about/library-maps/","source_title":"Lavery Library Maps","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Group spaces may be reserved only for building-partner events; when not in use by those partners, they are open and available for students.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"barnstead-classroom-l319","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Steven W. '84 and Susan M. Barnstead Cla